name sam-sa6-engage-1
timeout 200

# THE THREE STAGES, MEASURED. One F-16 flies straight at a 2K12 position; the position finds it, tracks
# it, waits out its reaction time and shoots. doc/modules/ground/module.md, acceptance criteria 3 and 4.
#
# WHAT THE POSITION HAS: an acquisition set at 50 km on a 6 s revolution, a CW illuminator out to 28 km,
# an envelope of 6-22 km horizontally and 100-7 000 m of altitude, a [T3] reaction time of 26 s and
# three 3M9 on one TEL. Everything else about it is its module name.
#
# WHAT TO READ, and this is the number this round exists to produce:
#   events.log   `site STATE ... to=SEARCH` -> `to=TRACK` -> `to=ENGAGE` -> `sms RELEASE`, and on the
#                VIPER's side `rwr THREAT_NEW mode=search` -> `THREAT_MODE to=track` -> `to=missile`.
#                The elapsed time between the viper's `track` and `missile` symbols IS `reaction_s`,
#                +- one decision tick, and it is what a pilot has between "he has me" and "it is up".
#   telemetry_sam.csv  site_state (0 cold / 1 dark / 2 search / 3 track / 4 engage / 5 scoot / 6 reload),
#                site_beam0, site_beam1, site_rounds, site_rails, site_trk_rng
#   telemetry.csv      rwr_mode, rwr_launch
#
# THE TWO ANTENNAS ARE THE POINT: while the position is tracking, beam 0 keeps sweeping (site_beam0 = 1)
# AND beam 1 stares (site_beam1 = 2). A single-beam signature would have deleted the search symbol for
# exactly the aircraft being tracked.
#
# READING RULE: the viper carries no objectives and no weapons; it flies a straight line into a missile.
# Exit 2 = CRASH is the EXPECTED verdict and the pass — the round hits. A run that ends 3 = TIMEOUT with
# no `sms RELEASE` line is the failure.

unit viper
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.40000 6.90000 3000 0.0 400          # 24 km south of the position, heading north at 400 kt
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off                             # nothing on this jet radiates: the position is not cued
  set rwr on
  wp 46.75000 6.90000 3000 400

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.62000 6.90000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon free                               # radiating from t = 0 — this file measures the CLOCK
  set rounds 3
